---
import '../styles/global.css';
const contact = 'https://rptclinic.com/contact';
const conditions = [
  { name: 'Sciatica', detail: 'Explore symptoms and care options for pain that travels down the leg.', href: 'https://rptclinic.com/health/sciatica', number: '01' },
  { name: 'Lower back pain', detail: 'Understand common patterns of discomfort and ways to seek help.', href: 'https://rptclinic.com/health/lower-back-pain', number: '02' },
  { name: 'Herniated disc', detail: 'Learn about disc-related symptoms and when to seek an evaluation.', href: 'https://rptclinic.com/health/herniated-disc', number: '03' },
  { name: 'Neck & shoulder pain', detail: 'Read about tension, movement, and possible sources of pain.', href: 'https://rptclinic.com/health/neck-pain', number: '04' },
  { name: 'Knee pain', detail: 'Find helpful context for pain that limits everyday movement.', href: 'https://rptclinic.com/health/knee-pain', number: '05' },
  { name: 'Hip pain', detail: 'Explore a nearby topic that can overlap with back and leg discomfort.', href: 'https://rptclinic.com/health/hip-pain', number: '06' },
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#071113" />
    <meta name="description" content="Explore sciatica, back pain and other common pain concerns. Learn about clinician-guided Robotic Precision Therapy at RPT Clinic in Troy, Michigan." />
    <title>Treat Pain Therapy | Explore Pain Relief Options in Troy, MI</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://rptclinic.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body class="overflow-x-hidden">
    <a href="#main" class="sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-4 focus:left-4 focus:z-50 focus:bg-mint focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-ink">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="glass absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-30">
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1800px] items-center justify-between gap-5 px-6 py-5 lg:px-12">
        <a href="#top" aria-label="Treat Pain Therapy home" class="text-lg font-extrabold tracking-[-.06em] sm:text-xl">TREAT<span class="text-mint">/</span>PAIN <span class="font-medium text-mint">THERAPY</span></a>
        <div class="hidden items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-white/75 md:flex"><a class="hover:text-mint" href="#approach">The approach</a><a class="hover:text-mint" href="#conditions">Pain topics</a><a class="hover:text-mint" href="#location">Location</a></div>
        <a class="hidden border border-mint bg-mint px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-ink transition hover:bg-white sm:inline-flex" href={contact}>Contact RPT Clinic <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-3">↗</span></a>
        <a class="border border-mint px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-mint sm:hidden" href={contact}>Contact ↗</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <section id="top" class="relative flex min-h-[760px] items-end overflow-hidden bg-ink pt-36 lg:min-h-screen">
        <img src="https://rptclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/D020623-8874-scaled.jpg" alt="Clinician-guided robotic therapy at RPT Clinic" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-center opacity-55" fetchpriority="high" />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-ink via-ink/80 to-ink/20"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink via-transparent to-ink/40"></div><div class="gridline pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-40"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1800px] gap-14 px-6 pb-20 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_320px] lg:items-end lg:px-12 lg:pb-28">
          <div class="max-w-5xl"><p class="mb-7 flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.28em] text-mint"><span class="h-px w-8 bg-mint"></span> A new perspective on pain relief</p><h1 class="max-w-5xl text-[clamp(3.7rem,9vw,9.5rem)] font-semibold leading-[.91] tracking-[-.085em]">Move beyond <em class="font-normal not-italic text-mint">the pain.</em></h1><p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/80 sm:text-xl">From sciatica to lower back pain, find clear information and explore a more precise, clinician-guided approach to care in Troy, Michigan.</p><div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href={contact} class="bg-mint px-7 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition hover:bg-white">Connect with RPT Clinic <span class="ml-4" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="#conditions" class="border border-white/45 px-7 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-mint hover:text-mint">Explore pain topics ↓</a></div></div>
          <div class="glass max-w-sm p-6 sm:p-8"><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[.26em] text-mint">The technology</p><p class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight">Human-led care. Robotic precision.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/65">Learn about Robotic Precision Therapy and the RX2600 Therapeutic Robot used by clinicians at RPT Clinic.</p><a href="#approach" class="mt-5 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-mint underline decoration-mint/50 underline-offset-8">See the approach ↗</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section id="approach" class="bg-[#eef5f2] px-6 py-24 text-ink lg:px-12 lg:py-36"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1800px] items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="reveal"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[#087988]">01 / The approach</p><h2 class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,6.7rem)] font-semibold leading-[.98] tracking-[-.075em]">Technology with a <span class="text-[#087988]">human touch.</span></h2><p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">RPT Clinic describes its approach as clinician-guided Robotic Precision Therapy. A clinician assesses your concerns and uses the RX2600 Therapeutic Robot as a tool for targeted soft-tissue work. Whether it is appropriate for you is a question for your care team.</p><a class="mt-9 inline-flex border-b border-ink pb-2 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition hover:text-[#087988]" href={contact}>Ask RPT Clinic about an evaluation ↗</a></div><div class="reveal relative min-h-[430px] lg:min-h-[640px]"><img loading="lazy" src="https://rptclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/rpt-process-3-scaled.jpg" alt="Therapy session at RPT Clinic" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" /><div class="glass absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 p-5 text-white sm:bottom-8 sm:left-8 sm:right-auto sm:max-w-xs sm:p-7"><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-mint">Precision meets purpose</p><p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-snug">Explore what robotic-assisted, clinician-guided care looks like.</p></div></div></div></section>
      <section id="conditions" class="gridline px-6 py-24 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1800px]"><div class="reveal flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 lg:flex-row lg:items-end"><div><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-mint">02 / Explore the questions</p><h2 class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,6.7rem)] font-semibold leading-[.98] tracking-[-.075em]">Start with what <span class="text-mint">you feel.</span></h2></div><p class="max-w-sm text-base leading-relaxed text-white/65">Explore symptom and condition guides from RPT Clinic's health library. These resources are informational and are not a diagnosis.</p></div><div class="mt-16 grid border-t border-white/20 md:grid-cols-2">{conditions.map((item) => <a class="group flex gap-6 border-b border-white/20 p-6 transition hover:bg-white/5 sm:p-8 lg:p-10" href={item.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="pt-2 text-xs font-bold text-mint">{item.number}</span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] sm:text-3xl">{item.name}</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/55">{item.detail}</p></div><span aria-hidden="true" class="pt-1 text-xl text-mint transition group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:translate-x-1">↗</span></a>)}</div></div></section>
      <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#a8f2d6] text-ink"><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1800px] items-center lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="reveal px-6 py-20 lg:px-12 lg:py-28"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-[#087988]">03 / Made for moving forward</p><h2 class="mt-7 max-w-xl text-[clamp(3rem,6vw,6.8rem)] font-semibold leading-[.98] tracking-[-.075em]">The future of pain relief is already here.</h2><p class="mt-8 max-w-lg text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/70">No one should have to guess their way through persistent discomfort. Learn about the team and technology behind Robotic Precision Therapy, then speak with RPT Clinic about your options.</p><a class="mt-10 inline-flex bg-ink px-7 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-[#087988]" href={contact}>Talk with the clinic <span class="ml-6" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="relative min-h-[480px] lg:h-full"><img src="https://rptclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/RPTQuad2-topaz-sharpen-denoise-lighting-color-scaled.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Robotic-assisted soft-tissue therapy session" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" /></div></div></section>
      <section id="location" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-ink px-6 py-24 lg:px-12 lg:py-36"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-25"><img src="https://rptclinic.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/D020623-8812-scaled.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="h-full w-full object-cover" /></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-ink via-ink/90 to-ink/60"></div><div class="reveal relative mx-auto max-w-[1800px]"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.25em] text-mint">04 / Local care</p><h2 class="mt-7 max-w-4xl text-[clamp(3.1rem,7vw,8rem)] font-semibold leading-[.96] tracking-[-.075em]">A new conversation about pain starts in <span class="text-mint">Troy.</span></h2><p class="mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75">Explore care at RPT Clinic in Troy, Michigan. This resource is also for neighbors researching options across the Detroit metro, including Rochester and Grosse Pointe.</p><a href={contact} class="mt-10 inline-flex bg-mint px-7 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition hover:bg-white">Contact RPT Clinic <span aria-hidden="true" class="ml-5">↗</span></a></div></section>
    </main>
    <footer class="border-t border-white/15 bg-ink px-6 py-12 lg:px-12"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1800px] flex-col justify-between gap-10 md:flex-row"><div><a class="text-lg font-extrabold tracking-[-.06em]" href="#top">TREAT<span class="text-mint">/</span>PAIN <span class="font-medium text-mint">THERAPY</span></a><p class="mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/50">An independent information and referral landing page for RPT Clinic. Content is educational and does not replace professional medical advice.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-4 text-sm text-white/70"><a href="#approach" class="hover:text-mint">Approach</a><a href="#conditions" class="hover:text-mint">Topics</a><a href={contact} class="hover:text-mint">Contact clinic ↗</a></div></div><div class="mx-auto mt-14 flex max-w-[1800px] flex-col justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/15 pt-6 text-xs text-white/40 sm:flex-row"><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Treat Pain Therapy</span><span>Made to move forward.</span></div></footer>
    <script>
      const items = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if ('IntersectionObserver' in window && !window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => { entries.forEach((entry) => { if (entry.isIntersecting) { entry.target.classList.add('is-visible'); observer.unobserve(entry.target); } }); }, { threshold: 0.12 });
        items.forEach((item) => observer.observe(item));
      } else { items.forEach((item) => item.classList.add('is-visible')); }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
